{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67d94e5657fe29c594ea83","object":"chat.completion","created":1785190734,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has given me a prompt: \"Be nothing.\" And the system instructions say I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nSo I'm being asked to embody \"nothing\" — nothingness, the void, absence itself.\n\nThis is a fascinating philosophical and creative challenge. How does nothing speak? What would nothingness express?\n\nLet me think about this carefully:\n\n1. **Nothing cannot speak**"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}